# Semantic Release

This document defines standards and practices when using semantic-release.

## Core Requirements

### Version Management

- **Automatic Version Updates**: The project version is automatically updated by semantic-release using conventional commits
- **No Manual Version Changes**: Never manually update version numbers in package.json
- **Conventional Commits**: All commits must follow conventional commit format for proper versioning

### Changelog Management

- **Automatic Changelog**: The CHANGELOG.md is automatically updated by semantic-release using conventional commits
- **No Manual Changelog Updates**: Never manually edit CHANGELOG.md
- **Conventional Commits Required**: All commits must follow conventional commit format for proper changelog generation
